Id: php005w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_php
Fix: Set enable_dl = Off in php.ini.
References: php.ini directives
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, SI-10; ISO 8.9, 8.28; CE Secure configuration

PHP lets scripts load extension modules at runtime: a script an
attacker reaches loads whatever it finds. Turn enable_dl off.
Judged at the effective value across php.ini and its conf.d
drop-ins; the file named set it.
